.TH temporal-tui 1  "temporal-tui 1.0.1"
.SH NAME
temporal\-tui \- A fast terminal dashboard and control plane for Temporal
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBtemporal\-tui\fR [\fB\-\-config\fR] [\fB\-\-profile\fR] [\fB\-\-address\fR] [\fB\-n\fR|\fB\-\-namespace\fR] [\fB\-\-api\-key\fR] [\fB\-\-tls\fR] [\fB\-\-tls\-ca\fR] [\fB\-\-tls\-cert\fR] [\fB\-\-tls\-key\fR] [\fB\-\-tls\-server\-name\fR] [\fB\-\-header\fR] [\fB\-\-codec\-endpoint\fR] [\fB\-\-codec\-header\fR] [\fB\-\-codec\-auth\fR] [\fB\-q\fR|\fB\-\-query\fR] [\fB\-\-page\-size\fR] [\fB\-\-refresh\-seconds\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-auto\-refresh\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-color\fR] [\fB\-\-read\-only\fR] [\fB\-\-web\-ui\-url\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-V\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR] [\fIsubcommands\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
A fast terminal dashboard and control plane for Temporal
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-config\fR \fI<CONFIG>\fR
Alternate config file. Defaults to the platform user config directory
.TP
\fB\-\-profile\fR \fI<PROFILE>\fR
Named connection profile
.TP
\fB\-\-address\fR \fI<ADDRESS>\fR
Temporal frontend address. A scheme is optional
.TP
\fB\-n\fR, \fB\-\-namespace\fR \fI<NAMESPACE>\fR
Namespace selected at startup
.TP
\fB\-\-api\-key\fR \fI<API_KEY>\fR
Temporal Cloud API key. Prefer `profile set\-api\-key`
.TP
\fB\-\-tls\fR
Enable TLS even when the address does not use an https scheme
.TP
\fB\-\-tls\-ca\fR \fI<TLS_CA>\fR
PEM\-encoded server CA certificate
.TP
\fB\-\-tls\-cert\fR \fI<TLS_CERT>\fR
PEM\-encoded mTLS client certificate
.TP
\fB\-\-tls\-key\fR \fI<TLS_KEY>\fR
PEM\-encoded mTLS client private key
.TP
\fB\-\-tls\-server\-name\fR \fI<TLS_SERVER_NAME>\fR
TLS server name override
.TP
\fB\-\-header\fR \fI<HEADERS>\fR
Additional gRPC header in KEY=VALUE form. May be repeated
.TP
\fB\-\-codec\-endpoint\fR \fI<CODEC_ENDPOINT>\fR
Temporal Codec Server base URL; `{namespace}` is expanded in its path
.TP
\fB\-\-codec\-header\fR \fI<CODEC_HEADERS>\fR
Codec Server HTTP header in KEY=VALUE form. May be repeated
.TP
\fB\-\-codec\-auth\fR \fI<CODEC_AUTH>\fR
Codec Server Authorization header. Prefer the environment variable
.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-query\fR \fI<QUERY>\fR
Initial Temporal visibility query
.TP
\fB\-\-page\-size\fR \fI<PAGE_SIZE>\fR
Workflows loaded per cursor page
.TP
\fB\-\-refresh\-seconds\fR \fI<REFRESH_SECONDS>\fR
Automatic refresh interval in seconds
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-auto\-refresh\fR
Start with automatic refresh disabled
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-color\fR
Disable colors while retaining text status labels
.TP
\fB\-\-read\-only\fR
Block every Temporal mutation, including signals
.TP
\fB\-\-web\-ui\-url\fR \fI<WEB_UI_URL>\fR
Base URL of Temporal Web UI
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
temporal\-tui\-profile(1)
Manage connection profiles
.TP
temporal\-tui\-filter(1)
Manage saved visibility queries
.TP
temporal\-tui\-config\-path(1)
Print the active config path
.TP
temporal\-tui\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
.SH VERSION
v1.0.1
